Third-party software
--------------------
The app bundles one separate program, its media engine, built from FFmpeg, x264
and x265 (GNU GPL v2 or later), LAME (GNU LGPL) and libwebp and dav1d (BSD). Those
parts are not covered by the Apache License: they keep their own licences, listed
in Resources/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt. Their exact source tarballs are in
vendor/sources, and scripts/build-media-engine.sh rebuilds the engine from them.
